      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BARAZIN (1) will appreciate the drop in grade and proven at the trip. Defeated a good field at Grafton two back, then came to town with a battling seventh over 2030m at Doomben. Gets the right run and can play a leading role in this company. AMPLIFY (2) due for a change of luck this prep and looks seasoned enough to get the trip. Closed off strongly to secure third over 1815m at Eagle Farm in BM70 class. Genuine each way contender. OUR TURN NOW (3) had excuses at his last couple of outings and can return to form from the good gate. Went back from the outside gate and gave away too much start with a battling ninth over 1815m at Eagle Farm last. Should stalk the tempo and return to form. MAD ANA (4) up sharply in class today after she shouldered the 61.5kg for a fading fourth over 1900m at Casino. Placed at the trip and can add value to the exotics.",
